ishing ideas"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"YouTube generator, video script generator, prompt generator"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"AI can produce options quickly, but platform fit still needs human judgment."}]]}],["$","tr","Technical work",{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"Technical work"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Code review, regex generation, formulas, and structured output"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"AI code reviewer, AI regex generator, Excel formula assistant"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Treat outputs as review candidates, not automatic truth."}]]}],["$","tr","Ecommerce research",{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"Ecommerce research"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Marketplace descriptions, keywords, and competitor notes"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Listing generator, keyword analyzer, competitor tracker, market insights"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Validate AI-generated claims against platform rules and real SERPs."}]]}],["$","tr","Meetings and reports",{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"Meetings and reports"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Capturing notes, summarizing discussions, and drafting status updates"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Meetin